    <p class="dcwr-label dcwr-section__eyebrow">One statement, four ways to wear it</p>
    <div class="dcwr-panel">
      <h2>The story</h2>
      <p class="dcwr-rte">The Color Statement Tee is the piece the whole collection grew out of. The hand-drawn lettering is built up out of overlapping colour blocks, so the print reads differently depending on how far away you stand from it.</p>
      <p class="dcwr-rte">It comes in two shirt colours and two print treatments: the full-colour version for a loud, saturated look and the sketch version, which keeps the raw pencil lines of the original drawing. Pick your combination of colour, print and size — every option is the same price.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dcwr-panel">
