      <ul class="dcwr-list">
        <li>100% heavyweight combed cotton, 240 gsm</li>
        <li>Available in white and black, with a colour or sketch print</li>
        <li>Screen printed by hand in small batches</li>
        <li>Ribbed crew neck with shoulder-to-shoulder taping</li>
        <li>Regular unisex fit, XS to XXL</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="dcwr-panel">
      <h2>Care</h2>
      <ul class="dcwr-list">
        <li>Machine wash cold (30°C) inside out with similar colours</li>
        <li>Use a mild detergent — no bleach or fabric softener</li>
        <li>Do not tumble dry; hang to dry in the shade</li>
        <li>Iron on reverse, never directly on the print</li>
        <li>Do not dry clean</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="dcwr-panel">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <details class="dcwr-faq"><summary>What is the difference between the colour and sketch print?</summary><p>The colour print uses the full saturated palette of the original artwork. The sketch print keeps only the pencil outlines, which gives a quieter, more graphic result.</p></details>
